      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are okay points but they're a bit generic for a high level debate. i need more specific ammo. can you go deeper on the work incentive thing? like, i need the most crushing arguments that show why UBI is basically guaranteed to destroy the labor market and make people lazy. give me the most aggressive points possible for that specific angle.",
